                "reply_count": 1,
                "retweet_count": 2,
                "source": "Twitter Web Client",
                "text": "People seeking treatment for opioid addiction shouldn\u2019t have to navigate endless barriers just to get the care they need. My bill will expand access to methadone by allowing pharmacies to dispense it and physicians to prescribe it, putting people over profits and saving lives.  \nhttps://t.co/aKRjvInWqp",
