                "reply_count": 3,
                "retweet_count": 0,
                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "During COVID, we expanded telehealth for substance use disorder treatment and it saved lives. That\u2019s why @RepBrianFitz and I introduced the TREATS Act to make that policy permanent, ensuring Americans can access the care they need, when they need it.\nhttps://t.co/3SAk1WcX7v",
