                "quoted_status_profile_username": "NJSpotlightNews",
                "reply_count": 3,
                "retweet_count": 1,
                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "If you can fill a prescription for opioids at a pharmacy, you should be able to fill one for treatment. My Modernizing Opioid Treatment Access Act would expand methadone access, cut red tape, and put patients over profits. It\u2019s time we modernize care and save lives.",
