                "source": "Buffer",
                "text": "Johanna, a local nurse, sees the fear in her patients\u2019 eyes. For many, Medicaid is the only way they can afford care. With Republican cuts, these patients won\u2019t just lose coverage, they\u2019ll lose access to life-saving treatment. https://t.co/pfQyzvDzpj",
